<title>JAPAN: Chiyoda Integre - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chiyoda Integre - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.17		vs	    7.32</p>
<p> Operating	  350    million    vs	  229    million</p>
<p> Current	    344    million    vs	  239    million</p>
<p> Net		  126    million    vs	   82    million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.77 yen	  vs	    7.68 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Chiyoda Integre Co Ltd is a manufacturer of mechanical components, mainly for audio and office automation equipment.</p>
